WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:09.521
Hi, I’m Starlight’s AI receptionist. When renters call after hours, I answer questions using information your leasing team has approved.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:17.103
If someone wants a viewing, I ask for their name, callback number, and preferred time. Your team confirms the appointment.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:26.312
I email the details to your leasing team, so they know who to call back. Try the Starlight demo below.
